The Zero Waste Food Tracker is designed to help individuals, families, and small businesses reduce food waste by monitoring their food inventory and expiration dates. The primary goal is to promote sustainable living by encouraging better food management practices. Users can easily add food items, track when they will expire, and receive timely reminders to use them before they go bad. This not only minimizes environmental impact but also helps users save money and make informed decisions about meal planning. By turning leftover ingredients into opportunities for new recipes, the app contributes to a smarter and more eco-friendly kitchen.
